      "title": "Read me",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## ReCaVSR 4× video upscale\n\nOne-step streaming diffusion VSR on Wan2.2 TI2V-5B. It reads the clip in blocks (21 frames, then 8), upsamples each block, and encodes it as it goes. Audio and frame rate are preserved; Save Video stores the file without re-encoding.\n\n**Models** in `ComfyUI/models/recavsr/`: `transformer_int8_convrot.safetensors`, `flashdecoder.safetensors`, `prompt.safetensors`.\n\n**Settings**: scale 4 is what the model was trained for; `color_fix` `adain` or `wavelet` matches the source colour; `decoder` `flashdecoder` is the fast streaming path. `kernels fast` is the tested default; `exact` is the reference path.\n\nNode pack: [ComfyUI-ReCaVSR](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-ReCaVSR). Weights: [PedroMarinhoDev/ReCaVSR-ComfyUI](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/ReCaVSR-ComfyUI) and [kopper/ReCaVSR](https://huggingface.co/kopper/ReCaVSR)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## ReCaVSR 4× video upscale\n\nOne-step streaming diffusion VSR on Wan2.2 TI2V-5B. It reads the clip in blocks (21 frames, then 8), upsamples each block, and encodes it as it goes. Audio and frame rate are preserved; Save Video stores the file without re-encoding.\n\n**Models** in `ComfyUI/models/recavsr/`: `transformer_int8_convrot.safetensors`, `flashdecoder.safetensors`, `prompt.safetensors`.\n\n**Settings**: scale 4 is what the model was trained for; `color_fix` `adain` or `wavelet` matches the source colour; `decoder` `flashdecoder` is the fast streaming path. `kernels fast` is the tested default; `exact` is the reference path.\n\nNode pack: [ComfyUI-ReCaVSR](https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-ReCaVSR). Weights: [PedroMarinhoDev/ReCaVSR-ComfyUI](https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/ReCaVSR-ComfyUI) and [kopper/ReCaVSR](https://huggingface.co/kopper/ReCaVSR)."
